{"id":"5d6ac440f71a3538","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-one-action-priority-bound.md","title":"每阶段至多行动一次的优先损伤界","display":"lem-one-action-priority-bound — 每阶段至多行动一次的优先损伤界","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-one-action-priority-bound","aliases":["20-lem-one-action-priority-bound"],"display":"lem-one-action-priority-bound — 每阶段至多行动一次的优先损伤界","chapter":"7","section":"7.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Proposition 7.3.5 的阶段展开","source_printed_pages":[154],"source_pdf_pages":[188],"depends_on":["[[20-df-priority]]","[[20-df-fininjury]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-one-action-priority-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-one-action-priority-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-one-action-priority-bound — 每阶段至多行动一次的优先损伤界"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Proposition 7.3.5 的阶段展开"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>154</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>188</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"116befd67ce6228f\" href=\"?note=116befd67ce6228f\" title=\"20-df-priority\">20-df-priority</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"423b4c2674336774\" href=\"?note=423b4c2674336774\" title=\"20-df-fininjury\">20-df-fininjury</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PriorityRecord}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{PriorityRecord}(C)\\)</span> 的构造。每次较高策略行动都初始化全部较低策略；第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个策略在首次初始化之前及任意相邻两次初始化之间至多行动一次。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k:=\\{s:a(s)=k\\}\">\\(T_k:=\\{s:a(s)=k\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_k:=\\{s:a(s)\\in\\omega\\land a(s)&lt;k\\}\">\\(U_k:=\\{s:a(s)\\in\\omega\\land a(s)&lt;k\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"116befd67ce6228f\" href=\"?note=116befd67ce6228f\" title=\"20-df-priority\">20-df-priority</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"423b4c2674336774\" href=\"?note=423b4c2674336774\" title=\"20-df-fininjury\">20-df-fininjury</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}one\\text{-}action\\text{-}priority\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ [|T_k|\\le2^k\\land |U_k|\\le2^k-1],\\qquad\\operatorname{FiniteInjury}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}one\\text{-}action\\text{-}priority\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ [|T_k|\\le2^k\\land |U_k|\\le2^k-1],\\qquad\\operatorname{FiniteInjury}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>归纳：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|T_0|\\le1\">\\(|T_0|\\le1\\)</span>。若所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;k\">\\(j&lt;k\\)</span> 的行动集合有限，则至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{j&lt;k}|T_j|\">\\(\\sum_{j&lt;k}|T_j|\\)</span> 次初始化把第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个策略的运行划分为至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1+\\sum_{j&lt;k}|T_j|\">\\(1+\\sum_{j&lt;k}|T_j|\\)</span> 个阶段区间。因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|T_k|\\le1+\\sum_{j&lt;k}2^j=2^k,\\qquad |U_k|\\le\\sum_{j&lt;k}2^j=2^k-1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|T_k|\\le1+\\sum_{j&lt;k}2^j=2^k,\\qquad |U_k|\\le\\sum_{j&lt;k}2^j=2^k-1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>优先记录的真实损伤只能出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_k\">\\(U_k\\)</span> 内，故每个需求有限损伤。结论不覆盖每阶段内部可以反复行动的策略，也不说明其数学要求一定满足；后者仍需等待计算和最终成功的论证。</p>\n<p>来源：Proposition 7.3.5 的阶段展开；印刷页 154；PDF 第 188 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-priority","status":"resolved","id":"116befd67ce6228f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-priority]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-fininjury","status":"resolved","id":"423b4c2674336774","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-fininjury]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-priority","status":"resolved","id":"116befd67ce6228f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-priority]]；see [[20-df-fininjury]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-fininjury","status":"resolved","id":"423b4c2674336774","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-priority]]；see [[20-df-fininjury]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PriorityRecord}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"T_k:=\\{s:a(s)=k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U_k:=\\{s:a(s)\\in\\omega\\land a(s)<k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}one\\text{-}action\\text{-}priority\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ [|T_k|\\le2^k\\land |U_k|\\le2^k-1],\\qquad\\operatorname{FiniteInjury}(C).","display":true},{"tex":"|T_0|\\le1","display":false},{"tex":"j<k","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{j<k}|T_j|","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"1+\\sum_{j<k}|T_j|","display":false},{"tex":"|T_k|\\le1+\\sum_{j<k}2^j=2^k,\\qquad |U_k|\\le\\sum_{j<k}2^j=2^k-1.","display":true},{"tex":"U_k","display":false}],"bytes":1809,"backlinks":[{"id":"bb045b68eb24d902","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-lem-one-action-priority-bound]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。"},{"id":"0e3663ac78a646a4","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-lem-one-action-priority-bound]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"}],"outgoing":["116befd67ce6228f","423b4c2674336774"]}